procstep.procdesc:
The deposit table was updated to include 25 deposits that were renamed. For example, there were 2 deposits with the name "Pacific mine" and they were modified to add the State after the name - "Pacific mine (ID)" and "Pacific mine (NV)". 
Below is a list of changes:
Coosa Cassiterite mine = Coosa Cassiterite mine (No. 1 mine); 
Empire State = Empire State mines; 
Eufaula = Baker 1 (Eufaula bauxite district); 
Iron Creek = Iron Creek (No Name Zone); 
Magnet Cove rutile mine = Magnet Cove; 
Mammoth = Mammoth (CA); 
Mammoth = Mammoth (CO); 
Maturi/Birch Lake = Maturi; 
McIntyre mine = MacIntyre mine; 
Mineral Park mine = Mineral Park deposit; 
Misheguk Mountain = Misheguk Mountain deposit; 
Mountain Pass = Mountain Pass deposit; 
Myers Ranch mine = Meyers Ranch; 
Pacific mine = Pacific mine (ID); 
Pacific mine = Pacific mine (NV);
Red Mountain deposits = Red Mountain deposits (Kenai Chrome);
Rough and Ready = Rough and Ready (OR);
Rough and Ready = Rough and Ready (SD);
Sanford Hill/South Extension = Sanford Hill-South Extension;
Sierrita mine = Sierrita deposit;
Silica = Silica deposit;
Silver Peak mine brine operation = Silver Peak brine operation (Clayton Valley);
Tamarack, SMSU = Tamarack, Upper SMSU;
Thicketty Creeks = Thicketty Creek;
Young, Immel, Coy, New Market East Tennessee) = Young, Immel, Coy, New Market (East Tennessee mines).

The following were added: 
Alcoa Arkansas operations;
Bisoni fluorspar deposit (MB project);
Blazer fluorspar;
Bradshaw pits;
Bull Hill;
Cordero;
Cressman Gulch;
Dry Lake Antimony mine;
Emma;
Fluorspar King & Blue Bell;
Horseshoe;
Iowa Canyon mine;
Katahdin pyrrhotite deposit;
Lakes barite mine;
Lone Pine;
Maltby No. 2 mine;
Mammoth prospect;
Maturi Southwest;
Nevada fluorspar (Lander Co.);
Niblack;
Overton mine;
Reed mine;
Salmon River Bench;
Shannon Queen prospect;
Spar mine;
Tamarack, Lower SMSU;
Union Canyon mine;
Valery mine.

The following were deleted:
Indian Springs duplicate;
Bauxite (Reynolds);
Castle Dome mine;
Desert antimony (Wade) mine;
Goodnews Bay placer;
Heavy Spar;
Keystone;
Lemhi Pass;
Mill City;
Mineral Hill;
Mineral Hill lode;
Panther Run (No 1 Workings);
Panther Run (No 2 Workings);
Red Mountain.

Version 2.0 has 684 deposits.

Additional information was added to resources and production fields as needed.
